      "id": "claim_97627e49ad284de8aef5fcb7214f68c0",
      "statement": "`SANDBOX_TYPE` defaults to `langsmith`; the registry lazily loads one of six factories (`langsmith`, `daytona`, `modal`, `runloop`, `e2b`, or `local`), rejects unknown values with a supported-types `ValueError`, forwards provisioning options only to LangSmith, awaits native async factories, and runs synchronous factories in `asyncio.to_thread`.",
